<!-- ==================== BAB 1: PENDAHULUAN ==================== -->
<div class="page-break">
    <h2>1. Pendahuluan</h2>
    <p>
        Dokumen ini menyajikan <b>Logical Record Structure (LRS)</b> dari aplikasi 
        <b>E-Absensi Siswa</b>. LRS merupakan representasi dari struktur record secara logis 
        yang menggambarkan setiap tabel beserta field-field di dalamnya serta hubungan 
        antar tabel melalui <i>foreign key</i>.
    </p>
    <p>
        Berbeda dengan ERD yang menggambarkan hubungan konseptual antar entitas, LRS 
        menggambarkan struktur fisik tabel yang akan diimplementasikan dalam basis data. 
        Setiap record (baris) dalam tabel ditunjukkan dengan field-field lengkap beserta 
        tipe datanya.
    </p>

    <div class="info-box">
        <b>Teknologi Database:</b> MySQL / MariaDB<br/>
        <b>Framework:</b> Laravel 12 (Eloquent ORM)<br/>
        <b>Jumlah Tabel:</b> 15 tabel<br/>
        <b>Jumlah Foreign Key:</b> 18 FK constraint
    </div>

    <h2>2. Perbedaan ERD dan LRS</h2>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 20%;">Aspek</th>
            <th style="width: 40%;">ERD</th>
            <th style="width: 40%;">LRS</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><b>Fokus</b></td>
            <td>Hubungan antar entitas secara konseptual</td>
            <td>Struktur field dan koneksi FK antar tabel</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><b>Level</b></td>
            <td>Konseptual / Logical</td>
            <td>Logical / Physical</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><b>Representasi</b></td>
            <td>Entitas, Atribut, Relasi (kotak, oval, garis)</td>
            <td>Tabel dengan field lengkap dan tipe data</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><b>Foreign Key</b></td>
            <td>Ditunjukkan secara implisit melalui garis relasi</td>
            <td>Ditunjukkan secara eksplisit dengan referensi tabel.kolom</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><b>Tipe Data</b></td>
            <td>Tidak selalu ada</td>
            <td>Selalu ditampilkan</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><b>Kegunaan</b></td>
            <td>Tahap perancangan awal</td>
            <td>Tahap implementasi database</td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</div>

<!-- ==================== BAB 3: STRUKTUR LOGIS TABEL ==================== -->
<div class="page-break">
    <h2>3. Struktur Logis Tabel (LRS)</h2>
    <p>Berikut adalah struktur logis setiap tabel dalam format LRS. Field yang merupakan <b>Primary Key</b> ditandai dengan <span class="badge-pk">PK</span>, <b>Foreign Key</b> dengan <span class="badge-fk">FK</span>, dan <b>Unique Key</b> dengan <span class="badge-uk">UK</span>.</p>

    <!-- 3.1 USERS -->
    <h3>3.1. users</h3>
    <div class="lrs-box">
        <div class="lrs-header">users</div>
        <div class="lrs-fields">
            <table>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-pk">*id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [PK, AI]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">name</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">nip</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">email</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [UNIQUE, NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">password</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">role</span> <span class="lrs-type">: ENUM('super_admin','wali_kelas','orang_tua','guru','siswa','kepala_sekolah') [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">is_approved</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BOOLEAN [DEFAULT false]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">is_demo</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BOOLEAN [DEFAULT false]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">photo</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">email_verified_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">remember_token</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(100) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">created_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">updated_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3.2 CLASSES -->
    <h3>3.2. classes</h3>
    <div class="lrs-box">
        <div class="lrs-header">classes</div>
        <div class="lrs-fields">
            <table>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-pk">*id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [PK, AI]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">name</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">grade</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">major</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">description</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TEXT [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">status</span> <span class="lrs-type">: ENUM('active','inactive') [DEFAULT 'active']</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">created_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">updated_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page-break">
    <!-- 3.3 STUDENTS -->
    <h3>3.3. students</h3>
    <div class="lrs-box">
        <div class="lrs-header">students</div>
        <div class="lrs-fields">
            <table>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-pk">*id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [PK, AI]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">nisn</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">nis</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">name</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">email</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">gender</span> <span class="lrs-type">: ENUM('L','P') [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-fk">**class_id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [FK]</span> <span class="lrs-ref">→ classes(id)</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">phone_number</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">address</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TEXT [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">birth_place</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">birth_date</span> <span class="lrs-type">: DATE [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">photo</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">status</span> <span class="lrs-type">: ENUM('active','inactive') [DEFAULT 'active']</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">barcode_data</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [UNIQUE, AUTO-UUID]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">created_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">updated_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3.4 HOMEROOM_TEACHERS -->
    <h3>3.4. homeroom_teachers</h3>
    <div class="lrs-box">
        <div class="lrs-header">homeroom_teachers</div>
        <div class="lrs-fields">
            <table>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-pk">*id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [PK, AI]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-fk">**user_id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [FK]</span> <span class="lrs-ref">→ users(id)</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-fk">**class_id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [FK, NULLABLE]</span> <span class="lrs-ref">→ classes(id)</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">created_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">updated_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3.5 PARENTS -->
    <h3>3.5. parents</h3>
    <div class="lrs-box">
        <div class="lrs-header">parents</div>
        <div class="lrs-fields">
            <table>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-pk">*id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [PK, AI]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-fk">**user_id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [FK]</span> <span class="lrs-ref">→ users(id)</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">name</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">phone_number</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">relation_status</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">created_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">updated_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page-break">
    <!-- 3.6 PARENT_STUDENT -->
    <h3>3.6. parent_student <i>(Tabel Pivot)</i></h3>
    <div class="lrs-box">
        <div class="lrs-header">parent_student</div>
        <div class="lrs-fields">
            <table>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-fk">**parent_id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [FK, COMPOSITE PK]</span> <span class="lrs-ref">→ parents(id)</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-fk">**student_id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [FK, COMPOSITE PK]</span> <span class="lrs-ref">→ students(id)</span></td></tr>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="warn-box">
        <b>Catatan:</b> Tabel pivot ini mengimplementasikan relasi <b>Many-to-Many</b> antara 
        <i>parents</i> dan <i>students</i>. Satu orang tua dapat memiliki banyak anak (siswa), 
        dan satu siswa dapat memiliki banyak wali/orang tua.
    </div>

    <!-- 3.7 ABSENCES -->
    <h3>3.7. absences</h3>
    <div class="lrs-box">
        <div class="lrs-header">absences</div>
        <div class="lrs-fields">
            <table>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-pk">*id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [PK, AI]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-fk">**student_id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [FK]</span> <span class="lrs-ref">→ students(id)</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">attendance_time</span> <span class="lrs-type">: DATETIME [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">checkout_time</span> <span class="lrs-type">: DATETIME [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">status</span> <span class="lrs-type">: ENUM('hadir','terlambat','alpha','sakit','izin') [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">late_duration</span> <span class="lrs-type">: INTEGER [DEFAULT 0]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">reason</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TEXT [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-fk">**recorded_by</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [FK, NULLABLE]</span> <span class="lrs-ref">→ users(id)</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">latitude</span> <span class="lrs-type">: DECIMAL(10,8) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">longitude</span> <span class="lrs-type">: DECIMAL(11,8) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">ip_address</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(45) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">created_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">updated_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3.8 IZIN_REQUESTS -->
    <h3>3.8. izin_requests</h3>
    <div class="lrs-box">
        <div class="lrs-header">izin_requests</div>
        <div class="lrs-fields">
            <table>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-pk">*id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [PK, AI]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-fk">**student_id</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [FK]</span> <span class="lrs-ref">→ students(id)</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">request_date</span> <span class="lrs-type">: DATE [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">type</span> <span class="lrs-type">: ENUM('sakit','izin') [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">reason</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TEXT [NOT NULL]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">attachment_path</span> <span class="lrs-type">: VARCHAR(255) [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">status</span> <span class="lrs-type">: ENUM('pending','approved','rejected') [DEFAULT 'pending']</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-fk">**approved_by</span> <span class="lrs-type">: BIGINT [FK, NULLABLE]</span> <span class="lrs-ref">→ users(id)</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">created_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="lrs-field">updated_at</span> <span class="lrs-type">: TIMESTAMP [NULLABLE]</span></td></tr>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

